BUILD86 - Uber-orb legendary chance by difficulty

General uber-monster orbs now roll a legendary by difficulty: on Normal, 0 percent
legendary but a 75 percent chance at a blue (Epic) item; on Epic, 50 percent legendary;
on Legendary, 75 percent legendary.

Leinth and the Toxeus variants (Devourer of Blood, Enslaver of Souls, the Endless Hunt)
keep their current better orbs and drop rates, unchanged.

Database-only update. The map, quests and text are unchanged, so existing characters and
saves are unaffected.
